      <Docs>
        <summary>Both SIP INVITE and UPDATE are used for session refresh.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Both SIP INVITE and UPDATE are used for session refresh. SIP UPDATE will be used if UPDATE is in 'Allow' header. If UPDATE is not in 'Allow' header, then INVITE will be used.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/CarrierConfigManager.ImsVoice#SESSION_REFRESH_METHOD_UPDATE_PREFERRED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.CarrierConfigManager.ImsVoice.SESSION_REFRESH_METHOD_UPDATE_PREFERRED</code>.</a></format></para>
